# Project Structure

## Library (src/)
- src/components/{Name}/{Name}.tsx + types.ts + index.ts
- src/types/*.types.ts
- src/constants/*.const.ts
- src/hooks/use{Name}.ts
- src/utils/*.utils.ts
- src/styles/components/_{name}.scss

## Portal (portal/src/)
- portal/src/pages/{Name}/{Name}.tsx + {Name}.const.ts + {Name}.types.ts + index.ts
- portal/src/components/{Name}/{Name}.tsx + index.ts
- portal/src/constants/content.const.ts, numbers.const.ts
- portal/src/i18n/en.ts, es.ts, types.ts, I18nProvider.tsx
- portal/src/hooks/use{Name}.ts + index.ts
- portal/src/data/{name}.data.ts

Every page and component folder has an index.ts barrel export.
